      "id": "leicester",
      "title": "McKee et al., Paragliding through Hyrule, 2019-12-06",
      "url": "https://journals.le.ac.uk/index.php/pst/article/download/3330/3017/8787",
      "gives": "Vertical-only tower drop, approximately 70 m in around 22 s: approximately 3.2 m/s sink; visually settles in 2-4 frames at 30 fps.",
      "limitations": "Estimate; original video, input trace, build and error bounds absent. No horizontal-speed or forward-input sink/turn measurement. Neutral stick in our trial retains 5.845 m/s horizontal speed and is not the same protocol.",
